        "title": "Korea Government Bond Yields Fall Ahead of BOK MPC Meeting",
        "summary": "Korean government bond yields fell ahead of the BOK policy meeting, with 3-year and 10-year KTB yields down 1.8bp and 1.6bp to 3.822% and 4.160%. Foreign investors bought KTB futures. Planning and Budget Minister Park Hong-geun said no decision had been made on further KTB issuance cuts.",
