        "title": "Minister Park Hong-geun: KTB Issuance Reduction Scale Undecided",
        "summary": "Minister of Planning and Budget Park Hong-geun stated that the scale of additional Korean government bond issuance reduction using excess tax revenue has not yet been determined. He emphasized continuous monitoring of KTB market interest rates to decide on the appropriate response.",
        "published_at": "2026-10-21T15:30:00+09:00",
        "source": "Infomax"
      },
