        "title": "KTB Futures Open Higher as Public-Sector Bond Supply Outlook Eases",
        "summary": "KTB futures opened higher on foreign buying ahead of the BOK policy meeting. The government projected major public-sector bond issuance, excluding KTBs, at about KRW 59tn in Q4, down KRW 6tn from Q3. Further KTB issuance reductions remained under consideration.",
        "published_at": "2026-10-21T09:24:25+09:00",
        "source": "Infomax"
      },
      {
