        "title": "20-Year KTB Yield Briefly Trades Below 10-Year on Bond Recall Rumors",
        "summary": "The 20-year KTB benchmark traded 1.5bp below the 10-year yield at 10:11 a.m., amid rumors that insurers were recalling lent bonds and a high lending ratio. The closing report said 20-year yields subsequently rebounded; the intraday inversion did not persist in KOFIA closing quotations.",
        "published_at": "2026-10-21T10:16:52+09:00",
        "source": "Infomax"
      },
      {
        "id": "20261021131001438",
        "title": "Monetary Stabilization Bond Yields Normalize as BOK Buyback Expectations Fade",
        "summary": "High sell offers for Monetary Stabilization Bonds (MSBs) emerged as BOK buyback expectations for certain maturities faded, leading to yield normalization. MSB yields remain significantly lower than KTB yields, raising concerns about their market reflection and yield curve utility.",
        "published_at": "2026-10-21T13:10:00+09:00",
