        "title": "Korea Conducts 3.50 Trillion Won Government Bond Buyback",
        "summary": "The Korean government conducted a buyback of 3.50 trillion won in government bonds. The weighted average successful bid rates for the buyback ranged from 3.585% to 4.110%.",
        "published_at": "2026-10-21T11:49:20+09:00",
