        "title": "KTB Yields Decline Amid Foreign Buying Despite Hawkish BOK Expectations",
        "summary": "Korean government bond yields continued to fall, with foreign investors leading the trend by net buying KTB futures and spot bonds. This occurred despite expectations of a hawkish BOK Monetary Policy Committee, as some foreign investment banks anticipate a lower terminal rate for the policy rate.",
